title Home Assistant: the phone scans the code and signs in: "Connected as deck", then the dashboard (no favourite yet; the areas as tabs)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO connect
env HA_DEMO_PHONE ok

wait 1700
shot connected-as
check connected-as
expect text "Connected as deck"
wait 2500
shot home-after-pairing
check home-after-pairing
expect text "Online"
expect text "Favourites"
expect text "Bedroom"
expect text "No favourites yet. Open a device (in All, or by its name here) and add it."
expect noquit
